#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-test-mustache-spec.md:1
msgid "llvm-test-mustache-spec - LLVM tool to test Mustache library compliance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-test-mustache-spec.md:6
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-test-mustache-spec.md:8
msgid "{program}`llvm-test-mustache-spec` \\[*inputs...*\\]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-test-mustache-spec.md:10
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-test-mustache-spec.md:12
msgid ""
"`llvm-test-mustache-spec` tests the mustache spec conformance of the LLVM "
"mustache library. The spec can be found here: <https://github.com/mustache/"
"spec>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-test-mustache-spec.md:15
msgid ""
"To test against the spec, simply download the spec and pass the test JSON "
"files to the driver. Each spec file should have a list of tests for "
"compliance with the spec. These are loaded as test cases, and rendered with "
"our Mustache implementation, which is then compared against the expected "
"output from the spec."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-test-mustache-spec.md:21
msgid ""
"The current implementation only supports non-optional parts of the spec, so "
"we do not expect any of the dynamic-names, inheritance, or lambda tests to "
"pass. Additionally, Triple Mustache is not supported. Unsupported tests are "
"marked as XFail and are removed from the XFail list as they are fixed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-test-mustache-spec.md:26
msgid ""
"The tool prints the number of test failures and successes in each of the "
"test files to standard output."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-test-mustache-spec.md:29
msgid "EXAMPLE"
msgstr ""
